# S-844 T-964: DotAccess in Call-func position produces Pattern::Constructor with qualified tag.
# [Result.Ok v] → Constructor { tag: "Result.Ok", binding: Some(Pin("v")) }
# Parser accepts this syntax. Variant tags are qualified (Result.Ok, etc.) after S-850.
# The _ arm fires here because the scrutinee is a String "x", not a Result.Ok variant.
[match "x"
    [case [let v] [Result.Ok v] v]
    _:             "other"]
=== out
String("other")
